{{apichanges|11.1.7|prev=11.1.5|next=11.2.0}}

==Summary==
* Added a new {{api|t=a|C_AddOnProfiler.MeasureCall(func, ...)}} API for profiling individual function calls.
* Added a new {{api|t=a|C_AddOns.GetAddOnLocalTable(name)}} API that can retrieve the namespace table of an addon that opts-in to sharing it via a new AllowAddOnTableAccess TOC directive.
* Added a new {{api|t=a|table.create(arraySizeHint[, nodeSizeHint])}} API that preallocates a table with a specified internal size.

==Resources==
* TOC: <code>110107</code>
* Official patch notes: [https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24206706/legacy-of-arathor-update-notes#item9 Legacy of Arathor Update Notes]
* Diffs: [https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/compare/11.1.5..11.1.7 wow-ui-source], [https://github.com/Ketho/BlizzardInterfaceResources/compare/11.1.5..11.1.7 BlizzardInterfaceResources]
* Deprecated API: [https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/blob/11.1.7/Interface/AddOns/Blizzard_Deprecated/Deprecated_11_1_7.lua Blizzard_Deprecated]

